{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1787342264972,"sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call_179bab953ec94d1d91465ef2","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/cyr/kernel/scripts/mkpefi.py","newString":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Build the final PE32+ EFI application (shim-only mode).\n\nSingle source: the shim ELF (C firmware handshake + microkernel proper,\nlinked at IMAGE_BASE). The image is position-fixed (RELOCS_STRIPPED):\nOVMF must load it at the preferred ImageBase, which is free at boot.\n\"\"\"\nimport struct\nimport sys\n\nIMAGE_BASE = 0x100000\nSECT_ALIGN = 4096\nFILE_ALIGN = 512\nSUBSYSTEM = 10\n\nR_ABS64_TYPES = {1, 6, 7}\nR_X86_64_RELATIVE = 8\n\n\ndef align(x, a):\n    return (x + a - 1) & ~(a - 1)","oldString":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Build the final PE32+ EFI application.\n\nTwo-source merge:\n  * shim ELF  (C firmware handshake, linked at IMAGE_BASE)\n  * Go kernel raw binary (objcopy -O binary of kernel.elf) placed at GO_BASE\n\nThe combined image is position-fixed (RELOCS_STRIPPED): OVMF must load it at\nthe preferred ImageBase, which is free at boot. The shim's placeholder magic\nconstants are patched with the Go image's real entry/end addresses.\n\"\"\"\nimport os\nimport struct\nimport sys\n\nIMAGE_BASE = 0x100000\nSECT_ALIGN = 4096\nFILE_ALIGN = 512\nSUBSYSTEM = 10\n\nGO_ENTRY_MAGIC = (0xB10B1A7C0FFEE001).to_bytes(8, \"little\")\nGO_END_MAGIC = (0xB10B1A7C0FFEE002).to_bytes(8, \"little\")\n\nR_ABS64_TYPES = {1, 6, 7}\nR_X86_64_RELATIVE = 8\n\n\ndef align(x, a):\n    return (x + a - 1) & ~(a - 1)"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /home/cyr/kernel/scripts/mkpefi.py\n===================================================================\n--- /home/cyr/kernel/scripts/mkpefi.py\n+++ /home/cyr/kernel/scripts/mkpefi.py\n@@ -1,27 +1,19 @@\n #!/usr/bin/env python3\n-\"\"\"Build the final PE32+ EFI application.\n+\"\"\"Build the final PE32+ EFI application (shim-only mode).\n \n-Two-source merge:\n-  * shim ELF  (C firmware handshake, linked at IMAGE_BASE)\n-  * Go kernel raw binary (objcopy -O binary of kernel.elf) placed at GO_BASE\n-\n-The combined image is position-fixed (RELOCS_STRIPPED): OVMF must load it at\n-the preferred ImageBase, which is free at boot. The shim's placeholder magic\n-constants are patched with the Go image's real entry/end addresses.\n+Single source: the shim ELF (C firmware handshake + microkernel proper,\n+linked at IMAGE_BASE). The image is position-fixed (RELOCS_STRIPPED):\n+OVMF must load it at the preferred ImageBase, which is free at boot.\n \"\"\"\n-import os\n import struct\n import sys\n \n IMAGE_BASE = 0x100000\n SECT_ALIGN = 4096\n FILE_ALIGN = 512\n SUBSYSTEM = 10\n \n-GO_ENTRY_MAGIC = (0xB10B1A7C0FFEE001).to_bytes(8, \"little\")\n-GO_END_MAGIC = (0xB10B1A7C0FFEE002).to_bytes(8, \"little\")\n-\n R_ABS64_TYPES = {1, 6, 7}\n R_X86_64_RELATIVE = 8\n \n \n","filediff":{"file":"/home/cyr/kernel/scripts/mkpefi.py","patch":"Index: /home/cyr/kernel/scripts/mkpefi.py\n===================================================================\n--- /home/cyr/kernel/scripts/mkpefi.py\n+++ /home/cyr/kernel/scripts/mkpefi.py\n@@ -1,27 +1,19 @@\n #!/usr/bin/env python3\n-\"\"\"Build the final PE32+ EFI application.\n+\"\"\"Build the final PE32+ EFI application (shim-only mode).\n \n-Two-source merge:\n-  * shim ELF  (C firmware handshake, linked at IMAGE_BASE)\n-  * Go kernel raw binary (objcopy -O binary of kernel.elf) placed at GO_BASE\n-\n-The combined image is position-fixed (RELOCS_STRIPPED): OVMF must load it at\n-the preferred ImageBase, which is free at boot. The shim's placeholder magic\n-constants are patched with the Go image's real entry/end addresses.\n+Single source: the shim ELF (C firmware handshake + microkernel proper,\n+linked at IMAGE_BASE). The image is position-fixed (RELOCS_STRIPPED):\n+OVMF must load it at the preferred ImageBase, which is free at boot.\n \"\"\"\n-import os\n import struct\n import sys\n \n IMAGE_BASE = 0x100000\n SECT_ALIGN = 4096\n FILE_ALIGN = 512\n SUBSYSTEM = 10\n \n-GO_ENTRY_MAGIC = (0xB10B1A7C0FFEE001).to_bytes(8, \"little\")\n-GO_END_MAGIC = (0xB10B1A7C0FFEE002).to_bytes(8, \"little\")\n-\n R_ABS64_TYPES = {1, 6, 7}\n R_X86_64_RELATIVE = 8\n \n \n","additions":4,"deletions":12},"truncated":false},"title":"home/cyr/kernel/scripts/mkpefi.py","time":{"start":1787342264887,"end":1787342264902}},"id":"prt_025e699a4001P29YZvv9S77uaK","sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","messageID":"msg_025e64fea001eDUskcAkBbGBGx"}}
