{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1787342541801,"sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_7e2fd8946e654619a8f219b4","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/cyr/kernel/kernel/vm/isa.h"},"output":"<path>/home/cyr/kernel/kernel/vm/isa.h</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: #ifndef VM_ISA_H\n2: #define VM_ISA_H\n3: #include <stdint.h>\n4: \n5: /* Restricted guest ISA (fixed 16-byte instructions).\n6:  *\n7:  * Scalar core:  MOV, LEA, SUB, JZ        - fetch/decode, jump tables, control\n8:  * Vector unit:  VMOVDQU, VPBROADCAST,\n9:  *               VPSUB, VPCMPEQ           - bulk array math on 256-bit lanes\n10:  * Supervisor:   HALT                     - stops the machine\n11:  */\n12: \n13: enum {\n14:     OP_MOV = 1,\n15:     OP_LEA,\n16:     OP_SUB,\n17:     OP_JZ,\n18:     OP_VMOVDQU,\n19:     OP_VPBROADCAST,\n20:     OP_VPSUB,\n21:     OP_VPCMPEQ,\n22:     OP_HALT = 0xFF,\n23: };\n24: \n25: /* aux field layout:\n26:  *   MOV:          mode = aux & 7   (0 imm->reg, 1 reg->reg, 2 mem->reg, 3 reg->mem)\n27:  *                 width sel = (aux >> 4) & 3   -> {1,2,4,8} bytes\n28:  *   SUB:          mode = aux & 7   (0 imm, 1 reg)\n29:  *   VMOVDQU:      bit7 = store (else load); src = gpr base reg; imm = disp\n30:  *   VPBROADCAST:  size class = aux & 3     (0=.b 1=.w 2=.d 3=.q)\n31:  *   VPSUB/VPCMPEQ:size class = aux & 3; second vreg = (aux >> 4) & 15\n32:  */\n33: struct insn {\n34:     uint8_t op;\n35:     uint8_t dst;\n36:     uint8_t src;\n37:     uint8_t aux;\n38:     uint32_t pad;\n39:     uint64_t imm;\n40: } __attribute__((packed));\n41: \n42: /* .vbin program blob */\n43: struct vbin_header {\n44:     char magic[4];     /* \"VBIN\" */\n45:     uint32_t version;  /* 1 */\n46:     uint32_t entry;    /* byte offset into code section */\n47:     uint32_t code_off;\n48:     uint32_t code_len;\n49:     uint32_t data_off;\n50:     uint32_t data_len;\n51: };\n52: \n53: #define VBIN_MAGIC \"VBIN\"\n54: \n55: /* guest console window inside the data segment */\n56: #define VM_CONSOLE_OFF 0xF000u\n57: #define VM_MIN_MEM     0x10000u\n58: \n59: #endif\n\n(End of file - total 59 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"#ifndef VM_ISA_H\n#define VM_ISA_H\n#include <stdint.h>\n\n/* Restricted guest ISA (fixed 16-byte instructions).\n *\n * Scalar core:  MOV, LEA, SUB, JZ        - fetch/decode, jump tables, control\n * Vector unit:  VMOVDQU, VPBROADCAST,\n *               VPSUB, VPCMPEQ           - bulk array math on 256-bit lanes\n * Supervisor:   HALT                     - stops the machine\n */\n\nenum {\n    OP_MOV = 1,\n    OP_LEA,\n    OP_SUB,\n    OP_JZ,\n    OP_VMOVDQU,\n    OP_VPBROADCAST,\n    OP_VPSUB,","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/home/cyr/kernel/kernel/vm/isa.h","text":"#ifndef VM_ISA_H\n#define VM_ISA_H\n#include <stdint.h>\n\n/* Restricted guest ISA (fixed 16-byte instructions).\n *\n * Scalar core:  MOV, LEA, SUB, JZ        - fetch/decode, jump tables, control\n * Vector unit:  VMOVDQU, VPBROADCAST,\n *               VPSUB, VPCMPEQ           - bulk array math on 256-bit lanes\n * Supervisor:   HALT                     - stops the machine\n */\n\nenum {\n    OP_MOV = 1,\n    OP_LEA,\n    OP_SUB,\n    OP_JZ,\n    OP_VMOVDQU,\n    OP_VPBROADCAST,\n    OP_VPSUB,\n    OP_VPCMPEQ,\n    OP_HALT = 0xFF,\n};\n\n/* aux field layout:\n *   MOV:          mode = aux & 7   (0 imm->reg, 1 reg->reg, 2 mem->reg, 3 reg->mem)\n *                 width sel = (aux >> 4) & 3   -> {1,2,4,8} bytes\n *   SUB:          mode = aux & 7   (0 imm, 1 reg)\n *   VMOVDQU:      bit7 = store (else load); src = gpr base reg; imm = disp\n *   VPBROADCAST:  size class = aux & 3     (0=.b 1=.w 2=.d 3=.q)\n *   VPSUB/VPCMPEQ:size class = aux & 3; second vreg = (aux >> 4) & 15\n */\nstruct insn {\n    uint8_t op;\n    uint8_t dst;\n    uint8_t src;\n    uint8_t aux;\n    uint32_t pad;\n    uint64_t imm;\n} __attribute__((packed));\n\n/* .vbin program blob */\nstruct vbin_header {\n    char magic[4];     /* \"VBIN\" */\n    uint32_t version;  /* 1 */\n    uint32_t entry;    /* byte offset into code section */\n    uint32_t code_off;\n    uint32_t code_len;\n    uint32_t data_off;\n    uint32_t data_len;\n};\n\n#define VBIN_MAGIC \"VBIN\"\n\n/* guest console window inside the data segment */\n#define VM_CONSOLE_OFF 0xF000u\n#define VM_MIN_MEM     0x10000u\n\n#endif","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":59,"totalLines":59,"truncated":false}},"title":"home/cyr/kernel/kernel/vm/isa.h","time":{"start":1787342541702,"end":1787342541742}},"id":"prt_025ead370001pxEulLgOrhkDsa","sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","messageID":"msg_025ea090a001JvFPgcdmYwxD8v"}}
