{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1787342544456,"sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","part":{"id":"prt_025eade30001z5C5GfgCi4IbJ1","messageID":"msg_025ead3d80015lWYZW2KohL4T4","sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1787342583789,"sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","part":{"id":"prt_025eb423b0011HsSAIKU0Q1XKc","messageID":"msg_025ead3d80015lWYZW2KohL4T4","sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","type":"text","text":"`isa.h` opcodes are unique — the `-Woverride-init` spam is just designated-inits beating the `[0...255]=&&illegal` range initializer. Benign.\n\nReal bug found: **CPUID OSXSAVE (bit 27) reads 0 until software sets CR4.OSXSAVE** — `cpu_enable_avx2()` tests it before enabling, bails with err 1, leaves XCR0 off, so the guest's first AVX2 instruction faults into an untested Plan-9-asm vector path and wedges. Fixing the chicken-and-egg ordering:","time":{"start":1787342570043,"end":1787342583779}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1787342583876,"sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call_5f53bbd5506e43b689213de3","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/cyr/kernel/kernel/vm/vector.c","newString":"int vec_cmpeq_all(const void *a, const void *b, int szcls, void *dst) {\n    switch (szcls & 3) {","oldString":"int vec_cmpeq_all(const void *a, const void *b, int szcls, void *dst) {\n    u64x4 m;\n    switch (szcls & 3) {"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /home/cyr/kernel/kernel/vm/vector.c\n===================================================================\n--- /home/cyr/kernel/kernel/vm/vector.c\n+++ /home/cyr/kernel/kernel/vm/vector.c\n@@ -67,9 +67,8 @@\n     }\n }\n \n int vec_cmpeq_all(const void *a, const void *b, int szcls, void *dst) {\n-    u64x4 m;\n     switch (szcls & 3) {\n     case 0:\n         __asm__(\"vpcmpeqb %2, %1, %0\"\n                 : \"=x\"(*(u8x32 *)dst)\n","filediff":{"file":"/home/cyr/kernel/kernel/vm/vector.c","patch":"Index: /home/cyr/kernel/kernel/vm/vector.c\n===================================================================\n--- /home/cyr/kernel/kernel/vm/vector.c\n+++ /home/cyr/kernel/kernel/vm/vector.c\n@@ -67,9 +67,8 @@\n     }\n }\n \n int vec_cmpeq_all(const void *a, const void *b, int szcls, void *dst) {\n-    u64x4 m;\n     switch (szcls & 3) {\n     case 0:\n         __asm__(\"vpcmpeqb %2, %1, %0\"\n                 : \"=x\"(*(u8x32 *)dst)\n","additions":0,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"home/cyr/kernel/kernel/vm/vector.c","time":{"start":1787342583799,"end":1787342583814}},"id":"prt_025eb77c5001P47gi8YRW3XRPE","sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","messageID":"msg_025ead3d80015lWYZW2KohL4T4"}}
