{"type":"text","timestamp":1787343050131,"sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","part":{"id":"prt_025f27a12001A3Tf7IG6dqS6j3","messageID":"msg_025f24412001p9lJHy7uIigqNt","sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","type":"text","text":"**Root cause**: vasm's pass 1 records label offsets as `len(p.text)*16` — but instructions are only appended in pass 2, so *every* text label resolves to 0. Data labels were fine (`.space` appends immediately); every branch target was zero. Classic two-pass bug. Fixing:","time":{"start":1787343043090,"end":1787343050123}}}
