c_khz/mm_pool retired (Go relics)\n- core/ is arch-blind: console_*/cpu_*/gdt/idt/paging contract in\n  core/plat.h, implemented by arch/x86_64/{uart,cpu,traps,paging,vector}\n- vm dispatch table: runtime-filled (C++ has no range designators)\n- gate: make TEST PASS from clean\" && git log --oneline | head -3","time":{"start":1787344527340,"end":1787344527346}},"id":"prt_026091fc20013te1PgGctQRHRK","sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","messageID":"msg_02608c4c7001Aqbh52fxuusITI"}}
